<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of United Waste Systems Inc with a buy rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-5/8 at 36-1/4.</p>
</text>
